  "description": "I Know No Limits!\nThe name says it all, the Rambo Dominator HD. You asked, we answered! Our customer base asked for a full suspension bike built around the serious outdoorsman to handle extreme terrain without killing you’re back. This E-Bike is engineered and highly tested to provide you with the ultimate Rambo riding experience. The Dominator is built in 2 different configurations (Ultra and HD) please understand both options to understand which one better suits you’re needs! The Dominator HD focuses on raw silent power and is a great choice if pedal feedback of the motor isn’t as important, but noise is important. Every aspect of our Dominator HD was designed and manufactured to produce an extremely reliable and durable E-Bike with NO limitations. Our Rambo Design Team closely studied every detail and component from the tread up as we developed the Dominator.",
